  "readme": {
    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "A Windows multi-bash plugin for DeepSeek Harness. gitbash (Git for Windows / MSYS) is on by default. wslbash (WSL), msys2bash (MSYS2 UCRT64) and sshbash (a remote shell over the OpenSSH client) are opt-in. terminal keeps a real PTY session alive between calls."
